  "text": {
    "tr": "<style id=\"modulex-kurum-main-style\">#modulex-kurum-main{width:100%;max-width:min(100%,var(--max,920px));margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 40px;background:#fff;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1.04em;line-height:1.74;color:#334155;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;}#modulex-kurum-main *{box-sizing:border-box;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero{border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(33,150,243,0.1),#f8fafc);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero p{margin:0;color:#475569;}#modulex-kurum-main h2{font-size:1.15em;margin:18px 0 10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main h3{font-size:1.02em;margin:14px 0 8px;color:#334155;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main ul{margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:1.2em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main li{margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 0 18px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card{border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #2196f3;background:rgba(33,150,243,0.06);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card strong{display:block;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card p{margin:0;font-size:0.92em;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-note{border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin:16px 0 0;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-contact{margin-top:16px;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}</style><div id=\"modulex-kurum-main\"><div class=\"kr-hero\"><p><strong>Vizyonumuz:</strong> Gaziantep ve bölgede ortopedi ve travmatoloji alanında güvenilir, yenilikçi ve erişilebilir bir referans hekim olmaktır.</p></div><div class=\"kr-grid\"><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Klinik</strong><p>Diz, kalça, omuz, spor yaralanmaları, kırık-çıkık ve protez cerrahisinde güncel tedavi seçenekleri.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Teknik</strong><p>Artroskopik (kapalı) cerrahi, minimal invaziv yaklaşımlar ve rehabilitasyon odaklı süreç.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Hasta deneyimi</strong><p>Şeffaf iletişim, güvenli ortam ve yaşam kalitesini artıran uzun vadeli takip.</p></div></div><h2>Vizyonumuz</h2><p>Op. Dr. Halil İbrahim Öçalan olarak vizyonumuz, ortopedi alanında sürekli gelişen tıp teknolojilerini yakından takip ederek hastalarımıza en güncel ve etkili tedavi yöntemlerini sunmaktır.</p><h3>Hedeflerimiz</h3><ul><li>Bölgesel düzeyde tanınan ortopedi uzmanlığı</li><li>Travma, spor cerrahisi ve protez alanında güncel protokoller</li><li>Hasta memnuniyeti ve güvenliği önceliği</li><li>Toplumda kas-iskelet sağlığı bilincinin desteklenmesi</li></ul><p>Hasta güvenliği, şeffaflık ve sürekli öğrenme vizyonumuzun temelidir.</p><p class=\"kr-contact\"><strong>İletişim:</strong> +90 533 643 74 27 · Özel Deva Hastanesi, 25 Aralık Mah. Tüfekçi Yusuf Bulvarı No: 98, Şahinbey/Gaziantep</p></div>",
    "en": "<style id=\"modulex-kurum-main-style\">#modulex-kurum-main{width:100%;max-width:min(100%,var(--max,920px));margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 40px;background:#fff;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1.04em;line-height:1.74;color:#334155;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;}#modulex-kurum-main *{box-sizing:border-box;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero{border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(33,150,243,0.1),#f8fafc);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero p{margin:0;color:#475569;}#modulex-kurum-main h2{font-size:1.15em;margin:18px 0 10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main h3{font-size:1.02em;margin:14px 0 8px;color:#334155;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main ul{margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:1.2em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main li{margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 0 18px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card{border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #2196f3;background:rgba(33,150,243,0.06);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card strong{display:block;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card p{margin:0;font-size:0.92em;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-note{border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin:16px 0 0;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-contact{margin-top:16px;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}</style><div id=\"modulex-kurum-main\"><div class=\"kr-hero\"><p><strong>Our vision:</strong> To be a trusted, innovative and accessible orthopedic reference in Gaziantep and the region.</p></div><div class=\"kr-grid\"><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Clinical</strong><p>Current options in knee, hip, shoulder, sports injuries, fractures and joint replacement.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Technical</strong><p>Arthroscopic and minimally invasive surgery with rehabilitation-focused care.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Experience</strong><p>Transparent communication, safe environment and follow-up that improves quality of life.</p></div></div><h2>Our Vision</h2><p>We follow advances in orthopedic technology to offer the most effective treatments to our patients.</p><h3>Goals</h3><ul><li>Recognized regional expertise in orthopedics</li><li>Modern protocols in trauma, sports surgery and arthroplasty</li><li>Patient safety and satisfaction as priority</li><li>Supporting musculoskeletal health awareness in the community</li></ul><p class=\"kr-contact\"><strong>Contact:</strong> +90 533 643 74 27</p></div>",
    "de": "<style id=\"modulex-kurum-main-style\">#modulex-kurum-main{width:100%;max-width:min(100%,var(--max,920px));margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 40px;background:#fff;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1.04em;line-height:1.74;color:#334155;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;}#modulex-kurum-main *{box-sizing:border-box;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero{border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(33,150,243,0.1),#f8fafc);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero p{margin:0;color:#475569;}#modulex-kurum-main h2{font-size:1.15em;margin:18px 0 10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main h3{font-size:1.02em;margin:14px 0 8px;color:#334155;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main ul{margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:1.2em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main li{margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 0 18px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card{border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #2196f3;background:rgba(33,150,243,0.06);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card strong{display:block;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card p{margin:0;font-size:0.92em;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-note{border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin:16px 0 0;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-contact{margin-top:16px;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}</style><div id=\"modulex-kurum-main\"><div class=\"kr-hero\"><p><strong>Unsere Vision:</strong> Ein vertrauenswürdiger, innovativer orthopädischer Ansprechpartner in Gaziantep und der Region zu sein.</p></div><div class=\"kr-grid\"><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Klinisch</strong><p>Aktuelle Optionen bei Knie, Hüfte, Schulter, Sportverletzungen und Prothetik.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Technisch</strong><p>Arthroskopie und minimal-invasive Verfahren mit Reha-Fokus.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>Erfahrung</strong><p>Transparente Kommunikation und langfristige Betreuung.</p></div></div><h2>Unsere Vision</h2><p>Wir verfolgen technologische Entwicklungen, um wirksame Behandlungen anzubieten.</p><h3>Ziele</h3><ul><li>Regionale Referenz in Orthopädie</li><li>Moderne Protokolle in Unfall- und Sportchirurgie</li><li>Patientensicherheit an erster Stelle</li></ul></div>",
    "ar": "<style id=\"modulex-kurum-main-style\">#modulex-kurum-main{width:100%;max-width:min(100%,var(--max,920px));margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 40px;background:#fff;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1.04em;line-height:1.74;color:#334155;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;}#modulex-kurum-main *{box-sizing:border-box;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero{border-radius:16px;padding:18px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(33,150,243,0.1),#f8fafc);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-hero p{margin:0;color:#475569;}#modulex-kurum-main h2{font-size:1.15em;margin:18px 0 10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main h3{font-size:1.02em;margin:14px 0 8px;color:#334155;font-weight:700;}#modulex-kurum-main p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main ul{margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:1.2em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main li{margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 0 18px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card{border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #2196f3;background:rgba(33,150,243,0.06);}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card strong{display:block;color:#1e293b;margin-bottom:6px;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-card p{margin:0;font-size:0.92em;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-note{border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin:16px 0 0;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}#modulex-kurum-main .kr-contact{margin-top:16px;font-size:0.92em;color:#64748b;}</style><div id=\"modulex-kurum-main\"><div class=\"kr-hero\"><p><strong>رؤيتنا:</strong> أن نكون مرجعاً موثوقاً ومبتكراً في العظام في غازي عنتاب والمنطقة.</p></div><div class=\"kr-grid\"><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>سريري</strong><p>خيارات حديثة في الركبة والورك والكتف وإصابات الرياضة والكسور.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>تقني</strong><p>جراحة تنظيرية طفيفة التوغل مع إعادة تأهيل.</p></div><div class=\"kr-card\"><strong>تجربة</strong><p>تواصل شفاف ومتابعة طويلة الأمد.</p></div></div><h2>رؤيتنا</h2><p>نتابع التطورات لتقديم أحدث العلاجات لمرضانا.</p><h3>أهدافنا</h3><ul><li>خبرة إقليمية في العظام</li><li>بروتوكولات حديثة في الصدمات وجراحة الرياضة</li><li>أولوية سلامة المرضى</li></ul></div>"
